<title>GERMANY: Siemens wins 250 mln DM Indonesia order.</title>
<headline>Siemens wins 250 mln DM Indonesia order.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German electronics and engineering giant Siemens AG said on Wednesday it had won a 250 million mark order to set up a mobile telephone network in Indonesia.</p>
<p>The system, for the private vendor PT Satelindo, will be installed by mid-1997.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
